flowchart TD
    A([Open the app]) --> B[Sign in or create an account]

    %% Account creation and approval
    B -->|Create account| N{Account type?}
    N -->|Student| N1[Student role is applied automatically]
    N -->|Faculty or Student Organization| N2[Request waits for administrator approval]
    N2 --> N3[Administrator approves and assigns roles]
    N3 --> N4[Email says the account is verified]
    N1 --> B
    N4 --> B

    %% Sign in and lockout
    B -->|Sign in| C{Sign-in successful?}
    C -->|No| R[Check your details and try again]
    R --> L{5 failed sign-ins?}
    L -->|No| B
    L -->|Yes| K[Account is locked]

    %% Forgot password
    B -->|Forgot password| FP[Reset link is emailed]
    K --> FP
    FP --> FR{5 or more resets in 24 hours?}
    FR -->|No| FL[Open the reset link within 4 hours]
    FL --> FN[Choose a new password and other sessions are signed out]
    FN --> B
    FR -->|Yes| K2[Account is locked and an administrator is notified]
    K2 --> U[Administrator unlocks the account]
    U --> B

    %% Role dashboards
    C -->|Yes| D[Your account opens the right dashboard]
    D -->|Student| S0[Open your profile]
    D -->|Faculty| F0[Open your faculty dashboard]
    D -->|Student Organization| O0[Open your organization dashboard]
    D -->|Administrator| M0[Open your administrator dashboard]

    S0 --> S1[Enter your major, year, and interests]
    S1 --> S2[Save your profile]
    S2 --> P[App checks access and handles your request]
    F0 --> F1[Review your account details]
    F1 --> F2[Update your own profile]
    F2 --> P
    O0 --> O1[Update your organization profile]
    O1 --> P
    M0 --> M1[Review approvals and locked accounts]
    M1 --> P

    P <-->|Read or save| DB[Saved information: Accounts, roles, profiles, sessions, password resets, and security events]
    P --> V[Your updated information appears]
    V --> E([Sign out when finished])

    %% Students: own records. Faculty: permitted content and authorized student progress.
    %% Student organizations cannot view student profiles.
    %% Resets for unknown accounts notify an administrator but show the same confirmation.
    %% All database access happens through the server.

    %% Colors match the original hand drawn workflow diagram.
    classDef startEnd fill:#dff1e6,stroke:#92b69e,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#253047
    classDef step fill:#f5f6f8,stroke:#c6ccd5,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#253047
    classDef decision fill:#fff3ce,stroke:#d7be78,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#253047
    classDef retry fill:#fff5ed,stroke:#dfbea3,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#253047
    classDef student fill:#e0edfc,stroke:#9bb7da,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#253047
    classDef faculty fill:#eee3f6,stroke:#bba2cc,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#253047
    classDef data fill:#fff5d9,stroke:#ccb77e,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#253047
    class A,E startEnd
    class B,D,P,V step
    class C decision
    class R retry
    class S0,S1,S2 student
    class F0,F1,F2 faculty
    class DB data
    linkStyle default stroke:#667085,stroke-width:2px
